    <so:abstract>A recently fired parking enforcement officer begins a sexual relationship with an experienced older woman, who encourages her to pursue a career as a private investigator-cum-sex worker in her search for a missing antifascist activist. She sells her body to a corrupt government official in exchange for her dream job of police detective, but ends up spending more time making love to her snowballing romantic circle than looking for her missing man.</so:abstract>
            
