    <so:accessibilitySummary>This publication had a result of 'Incomplete' for the ACE Smart WCAG 2 Level A conformance checker. Every non-decorative image has alternative text; complex images have long image descriptions; text has SSML phonetic, volume, pitch, emphasis, and language markup to improve TTS; and attention has been paid to navigational structure and minimum visual contrast. There are no accessibility hazards in the forms of sounds, flashing, or motion. However, due to budgetary and skill limitations, these features have not been tested with commercial screen readers (JAWS, BRLTTY, COBRA, et cetera), and for the same reasons neither could sign language transcription of the work be provided; furthermore, none of the free TTS utilities properly rendered the SSML markup in testing. Notwithstanding the unavailability of accessibility software for testing, lack of support among free EPUB text to speech readers, and lack of budget and skillset to certify accessibility, this EPUB document is expected to satisfy the accessibility needs of a majority of readers. Future suggestions or contributions to improve accessibility should be directed to the author at Fannie.Spanker@gmail.com.</so:accessibilitySummary>
    
